  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "你知道吗，这是全中国最神秘的一个地方，你竟然在任何地图都找不到它，它也无法被翻译成任何外语，它只有短短两个字，却浓缩了中国最复杂的人情社会，今天挑战一口气给你讲清楚，江湖。诸君，莫笑少年江湖梦，谁不年少梦江湖。#江湖 #武侠 #大侠 #功夫",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 382.386009,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？这里是全中国最神秘的一个地方，你竟然在任何地图上都找不到他他也无法被翻译成任何外语。他只有短短两个字，却浓缩了中国最复杂的人情社会。今天挑战一口气，给你讲清楚江湖朱君莫笑，少年江湖梦，谁不年少梦江湖，咱中国人到底有多离不开？江湖刚进入一个行业，叫初入江湖，干的久了叫老江湖。离开以后再回来叫重出江湖，不回回来就要退隐。江湖请朋友帮忙叫江湖救急，很多事情搞不定叫人在江湖身不由己，哪怕暂时分别也要说一句江湖再见。诸君，既然江湖见面，先来抱个拳，您习惯是左手在上还是右手在上呢？正宗的江湖权力啊，应该是右手握拳。左掌在外拳代表武力，掌代表规矩，左手大拇指还要微微内扣，这是提醒自己江湖这么大，先别着急称老大，双臂环抱，成员代表五湖四海，天下一家。怪不得武侠剧里面一句抱拳啊，接下来不是承让，就是得罪了中国人，就算准备动手也得先把礼数做周全，你知道吗？最开始的时候，江只是江胡，只是胡江是流动的大水，不是停留的。广水水路通到哪里，商船客船就到哪里，生意规矩和恩怨也就走到哪里。眼为江口，为虎所忘之处，皆江湖。江湖人最大体面就是这件事，我答应了，就一定办到。为什么中国人如此迷恋江湖？因为江湖保存了一种非常中国式的人生想象。郭靖守襄阳李寻欢小楼听雨令狐冲笑傲江湖。儒家强调入室佛家道家强调出世。但如果一个人进也进不得，出也出不得。当庙堂容不下你，家族无法庇护你时，你仍然可以走向天地之间，凭借自己的道义、胆识和承诺，重新成为自己。有人的地方就有江湖。刘晶，美国有牛仔，欧洲有骑士，中国有江湖大侠。小时候看武侠，看的是武骑快马喝烈酒。拍拍兄弟的肩膀说，有我在，仗剑走天涯，路见不平一声吼，该出手时就出手，同是天涯沦落人，相逢何必曾相识，你看北少林南武当峨眉派青城派，你知道为什么在江湖中丐帮叫帮唐门叫门，而华山派却叫派吗？同样是江湖组织门派帮教有什么区别呢？最难加入的是门，我们常说一门手艺独门绝技，比如四川唐门，以暗器为主，门主要靠家族血缘去传承，相当于专业技校比门更大的就是派，相当于综合性大学有一套完整的武学体系，比如武当派、内功、轻功拳掌样样精通，派的门槛相对比较低，不论出身、贫贱都可以办师学艺，可以学的内容也非常多。刀枪剑戟，斧钺勾叉铲棍，射棒，鞭拣锤抓拐子。刘杏十八般兵刃样样精通。帮类似于现在的职业行业协会，比如丐帮就是一群乞丐组成的，盐帮就是一群盐贩子组成的，还有近代的青帮，它的起源是清朝的粮传帮都是社会底层，平民抱团取暖和帮相近的概念，叫做会。比如天地会和红花卉，目的性非常明确，最后是教一般有共同的信仰，不管是范夫走卒还是江洋大盗，只要信仰一致都可以加入。比如明教神龙教，诸君，您是哪一派？哪一教呢？我呢我是回龙教的传承人，大侠从来不在于武功的高低，而在于有一颗怜悯的心。韩非说，儒以文乱法，侠以武犯境。司马迁说，言必信，行必果，以诺必成中国的侠客，相信一些时刻，一个普通人也可以匡扶正义，为民除害。你知道什么叫侠之大者，为国为民吗？抗战期间，张志忠先生主阵湖南省，他为了保护西南联大的学生，亲笔给湘西。各路土匪写信，各路陆林，豪杰山寨首领为剑，日寇压境，国难当头。今有北大清华、南开、三校学生、数百人皆国家读书种子、民族未来栋梁。为保存文脉求学救国，自长沙徒步西去昆明。此辈，身无长物，仅携书本手无寸铁，斯特恳切。拜托凡学生队伍经过勿忘高抬贵手放行保护，不加侵扰，误伤一人。而当时沿路的土匪是这样回信的。我辈，虽落草为寇，亦是炎黄子孙。中华儿女当知民族大义，为重定将，保护学生安全购进、保护此文脉，及所以护我之中华，留复兴之根。朱军武艺再高高不过天，资质，再厚厚不过地刀光剑影，儿女情长快意恩仇，天下苍生出试入试。都在江湖之中，渡尽劫波兄弟在相逢一笑泯恩仇。江湖从来不止属于大侠，还有走镖的、行医的、说书的、唱戏的、卖艺的、跑堂的三教九流五花八门。武侠以没有绝世武功，只要有一门本事，你就能在江湖上讨口饭吃武侠片，爱拍山顶决战可真实的江湖更可能出现在山下渡口码头、驿路客栈、茶馆、庙会和市场。江湖里卧虎藏龙，庞龙，人心里何尝不是刀剑里藏胸，人情里何尝不是诸君，人生有三碗面，最难吃，场面铁面情面。江湖可不是你想来就来想走就走的。庄子说，相濡以沫不如相忘于江湖。所谓江湖，就是五千年来中国人从未断绝的情谊与担当。桃李春风一杯酒江湖夜雨十年灯一人有意，便能守住侠气万千人有意便能守住山河。天下风云出我辈一入江湖岁月摧皇图霸业，谈笑中不胜人生一场醉。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00001",
      "start_ms": 390,
      "end_ms": 1030,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1170,
      "end_ms": 3410,
      "text": "这里是全中国最神秘的一个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3550,
      "end_ms": 8010,
      "text": "你竟然在任何地图上都找不到他他也无法被翻译成任何外语。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8210,
      "end_ms": 9690,
      "text": "他只有短短两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9750,
      "end_ms": 12270,
      "text": "却浓缩了中国最复杂的人情社会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12750,
      "end_ms": 13910,
      "text": "今天挑战一口气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13910,
      "end_ms": 17890,
      "text": "给你讲清楚江湖朱君莫笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17930,
      "end_ms": 19090,
      "text": "少年江湖梦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19210,
      "end_ms": 20830,
      "text": "谁不年少梦江湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21010,
      "end_ms": 22650,
      "text": "咱中国人到底有多离不开？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00011",
      "start_ms": 22650,
      "end_ms": 24290,
      "text": "江湖刚进入一个行业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24290,
      "end_ms": 25310,
      "text": "叫初入江湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25550,
      "end_ms": 26990,
      "text": "干的久了叫老江湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00014",
      "start_ms": 27350,
      "end_ms": 29570,
      "text": "离开以后再回来叫重出江湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29770,
      "end_ms": 31100,
      "text": "不回回来就要退隐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00016",
      "start_ms": 31120,
      "end_ms": 33480,
      "text": "江湖请朋友帮忙叫江湖救急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00017",
      "start_ms": 33680,
      "end_ms": 36600,
      "text": "很多事情搞不定叫人在江湖身不由己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00018",
      "start_ms": 36840,
      "end_ms": 39640,
      "text": "哪怕暂时分别也要说一句江湖再见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00019",
      "start_ms": 39980,
      "end_ms": 40420,
      "text": "诸君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00020",
      "start_ms": 40460,
      "end_ms": 41540,
      "text": "既然江湖见面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00021",
      "start_ms": 41540,
      "end_ms": 42460,
      "text": "先来抱个拳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00022",
      "start_ms": 42920,
      "end_ms": 45680,
      "text": "您习惯是左手在上还是右手在上呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00023",
      "start_ms": 45760,
      "end_ms": 47140,
      "text": "正宗的江湖权力啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00024",
      "start_ms": 47140,
      "end_ms": 48860,
      "text": "应该是右手握拳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00025",
      "start_ms": 49120,
      "end_ms": 51920,
      "text": "左掌在外拳代表武力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00026",
      "start_ms": 52100,
      "end_ms": 53220,
      "text": "掌代表规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00027",
      "start_ms": 53380,
      "end_ms": 55500,
      "text": "左手大拇指还要微微内扣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00028",
      "start_ms": 55600,
      "end_ms": 57660,
      "text": "这是提醒自己江湖这么大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00029",
      "start_ms": 57740,
      "end_ms": 59160,
      "text": "先别着急称老大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00030",
      "start_ms": 59620,
      "end_ms": 60510,
      "text": "双臂环抱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00031",
      "start_ms": 60510,
      "end_ms": 62130,
      "text": "成员代表五湖四海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00032",
      "start_ms": 62170,
      "end_ms": 63095,
      "text": "天下一家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00033",
      "start_ms": 63420,
      "end_ms": 66090,
      "text": "怪不得武侠剧里面一句抱拳啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00034",
      "start_ms": 66110,
      "end_ms": 67190,
      "text": "接下来不是承让，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00035",
      "start_ms": 67190,
      "end_ms": 68720,
      "text": "就是得罪了中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00036",
      "start_ms": 68720,
      "end_ms": 71285,
      "text": "就算准备动手也得先把礼数做周全，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00037",
      "start_ms": 71700,
      "end_ms": 72300,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00038",
      "start_ms": 72360,
      "end_ms": 73240,
      "text": "最开始的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00039",
      "start_ms": 73240,
      "end_ms": 74720,
      "text": "江只是江胡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00040",
      "start_ms": 74820,
      "end_ms": 77265,
      "text": "只是胡江是流动的大水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00041",
      "start_ms": 77580,
      "end_ms": 78600,
      "text": "不是停留的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00042",
      "start_ms": 78600,
      "end_ms": 80805,
      "text": "广水水路通到哪里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00043",
      "start_ms": 81040,
      "end_ms": 82585,
      "text": "商船客船就到哪里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00044",
      "start_ms": 82900,
      "end_ms": 85545,
      "text": "生意规矩和恩怨也就走到哪里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00045",
      "start_ms": 85960,
      "end_ms": 87000,
      "text": "眼为江口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00046",
      "start_ms": 87000,
      "end_ms": 88360,
      "text": "为虎所忘之处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00047",
      "start_ms": 88380,
      "end_ms": 89115,
      "text": "皆江湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00048",
      "start_ms": 89580,
      "end_ms": 91840,
      "text": "江湖人最大体面就是这件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00049",
      "start_ms": 91840,
      "end_ms": 92520,
      "text": "我答应了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00050",
      "start_ms": 92520,
      "end_ms": 93395,
      "text": "就一定办到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00051",
      "start_ms": 93760,
      "end_ms": 95695,
      "text": "为什么中国人如此迷恋江湖？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00052",
      "start_ms": 95980,
      "end_ms": 99115,
      "text": "因为江湖保存了一种非常中国式的人生想象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00053",
      "start_ms": 99580,
      "end_ms": 104285,
      "text": "郭靖守襄阳李寻欢小楼听雨令狐冲笑傲江湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00054",
      "start_ms": 104760,
      "end_ms": 107865,
      "text": "儒家强调入室佛家道家强调出世。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00055",
      "start_ms": 108230,
      "end_ms": 110330,
      "text": "但如果一个人进也进不得，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00056",
      "start_ms": 110330,
      "end_ms": 111305,
      "text": "出也出不得。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00057",
      "start_ms": 111620,
      "end_ms": 113080,
      "text": "当庙堂容不下你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00058",
      "start_ms": 113220,
      "end_ms": 114625,
      "text": "家族无法庇护你时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00059",
      "start_ms": 114890,
      "end_ms": 116745,
      "text": "你仍然可以走向天地之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00060",
      "start_ms": 117000,
      "end_ms": 119500,
      "text": "凭借自己的道义、胆识和承诺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00061",
      "start_ms": 119720,
      "end_ms": 121035,
      "text": "重新成为自己。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00062",
      "start_ms": 121370,
      "end_ms": 123305,
      "text": "有人的地方就有江湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00063",
      "start_ms": 123560,
      "end_ms": 124165,
      "text": "刘晶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00064",
      "start_ms": 124630,
      "end_ms": 125730,
      "text": "美国有牛仔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00065",
      "start_ms": 125950,
      "end_ms": 127010,
      "text": "欧洲有骑士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00066",
      "start_ms": 127230,
      "end_ms": 129115,
      "text": "中国有江湖大侠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00067",
      "start_ms": 129750,
      "end_ms": 130770,
      "text": "小时候看武侠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00068",
      "start_ms": 130770,
      "end_ms": 133395,
      "text": "看的是武骑快马喝烈酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00069",
      "start_ms": 133630,
      "end_ms": 134750,
      "text": "拍拍兄弟的肩膀说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00070",
      "start_ms": 134770,
      "end_ms": 135385,
      "text": "有我在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00071",
      "start_ms": 135620,
      "end_ms": 136705,
      "text": "仗剑走天涯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00072",
      "start_ms": 137020,
      "end_ms": 138260,
      "text": "路见不平一声吼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00073",
      "start_ms": 138320,
      "end_ms": 139715,
      "text": "该出手时就出手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00074",
      "start_ms": 140010,
      "end_ms": 141530,
      "text": "同是天涯沦落人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00075",
      "start_ms": 141650,
      "end_ms": 143555,
      "text": "相逢何必曾相识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00076",
      "start_ms": 143810,
      "end_ms": 147395,
      "text": "你看北少林南武当峨眉派青城派，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00077",
      "start_ms": 147750,
      "end_ms": 151970,
      "text": "你知道为什么在江湖中丐帮叫帮唐门叫门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00078",
      "start_ms": 152130,
      "end_ms": 153935,
      "text": "而华山派却叫派吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00079",
      "start_ms": 154330,
      "end_ms": 159105,
      "text": "同样是江湖组织门派帮教有什么区别呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00080",
      "start_ms": 159400,
      "end_ms": 160480,
      "text": "最难加入的是门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00081",
      "start_ms": 160740,
      "end_ms": 163345,
      "text": "我们常说一门手艺独门绝技，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00082",
      "start_ms": 163610,
      "end_ms": 164650,
      "text": "比如四川唐门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00083",
      "start_ms": 164650,
      "end_ms": 165715,
      "text": "以暗器为主，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00084",
      "start_ms": 166040,
      "end_ms": 168160,
      "text": "门主要靠家族血缘去传承，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00085",
      "start_ms": 168160,
      "end_ms": 171540,
      "text": "相当于专业技校比门更大的就是派，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00086",
      "start_ms": 171880,
      "end_ms": 175095,
      "text": "相当于综合性大学有一套完整的武学体系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00087",
      "start_ms": 175460,
      "end_ms": 179495,
      "text": "比如武当派、内功、轻功拳掌样样精通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00088",
      "start_ms": 179990,
      "end_ms": 181510,
      "text": "派的门槛相对比较低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00089",
      "start_ms": 181530,
      "end_ms": 183730,
      "text": "不论出身、贫贱都可以办师学艺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00090",
      "start_ms": 183870,
      "end_ms": 185410,
      "text": "可以学的内容也非常多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00091",
      "start_ms": 185610,
      "end_ms": 186710,
      "text": "刀枪剑戟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00092",
      "start_ms": 186770,
      "end_ms": 187970,
      "text": "斧钺勾叉铲棍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00093",
      "start_ms": 188050,
      "end_ms": 188450,
      "text": "射棒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00094",
      "start_ms": 188490,
      "end_ms": 189610,
      "text": "鞭拣锤抓拐子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00095",
      "start_ms": 189610,
      "end_ms": 192110,
      "text": "刘杏十八般兵刃样样精通。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00096",
      "start_ms": 192350,
      "end_ms": 194970,
      "text": "帮类似于现在的职业行业协会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00097",
      "start_ms": 195130,
      "end_ms": 197190,
      "text": "比如丐帮就是一群乞丐组成的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00098",
      "start_ms": 197310,
      "end_ms": 199290,
      "text": "盐帮就是一群盐贩子组成的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00099",
      "start_ms": 199330,
      "end_ms": 200470,
      "text": "还有近代的青帮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00100",
      "start_ms": 200550,
      "end_ms": 204250,
      "text": "它的起源是清朝的粮传帮都是社会底层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00101",
      "start_ms": 204290,
      "end_ms": 207390,
      "text": "平民抱团取暖和帮相近的概念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00102",
      "start_ms": 207390,
      "end_ms": 207850,
      "text": "叫做会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00103",
      "start_ms": 208070,
      "end_ms": 210160,
      "text": "比如天地会和红花卉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00104",
      "start_ms": 210220,
      "end_ms": 211340,
      "text": "目的性非常明确，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00105",
      "start_ms": 211700,
      "end_ms": 214460,
      "text": "最后是教一般有共同的信仰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00106",
      "start_ms": 214720,
      "end_ms": 217400,
      "text": "不管是范夫走卒还是江洋大盗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00107",
      "start_ms": 217540,
      "end_ms": 219360,
      "text": "只要信仰一致都可以加入。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00108",
      "start_ms": 219640,
      "end_ms": 221520,
      "text": "比如明教神龙教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00109",
      "start_ms": 221840,
      "end_ms": 222300,
      "text": "诸君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00110",
      "start_ms": 222460,
      "end_ms": 223380,
      "text": "您是哪一派？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00111",
      "start_ms": 223380,
      "end_ms": 224100,
      "text": "哪一教呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00112",
      "start_ms": 224120,
      "end_ms": 226360,
      "text": "我呢我是回龙教的传承人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00113",
      "start_ms": 226640,
      "end_ms": 228760,
      "text": "大侠从来不在于武功的高低，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00114",
      "start_ms": 228840,
      "end_ms": 230620,
      "text": "而在于有一颗怜悯的心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00115",
      "start_ms": 230940,
      "end_ms": 231560,
      "text": "韩非说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00116",
      "start_ms": 231680,
      "end_ms": 232880,
      "text": "儒以文乱法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00117",
      "start_ms": 232980,
      "end_ms": 234140,
      "text": "侠以武犯境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00118",
      "start_ms": 234400,
      "end_ms": 235100,
      "text": "司马迁说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00119",
      "start_ms": 235280,
      "end_ms": 236060,
      "text": "言必信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00120",
      "start_ms": 236080,
      "end_ms": 236720,
      "text": "行必果，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00121",
      "start_ms": 236820,
      "end_ms": 238840,
      "text": "以诺必成中国的侠客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00122",
      "start_ms": 238840,
      "end_ms": 240090,
      "text": "相信一些时刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00123",
      "start_ms": 240090,
      "end_ms": 242030,
      "text": "一个普通人也可以匡扶正义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00124",
      "start_ms": 242110,
      "end_ms": 243085,
      "text": "为民除害。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00125",
      "start_ms": 243610,
      "end_ms": 245390,
      "text": "你知道什么叫侠之大者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00126",
      "start_ms": 245550,
      "end_ms": 246565,
      "text": "为国为民吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00127",
      "start_ms": 247060,
      "end_ms": 247800,
      "text": "抗战期间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00128",
      "start_ms": 247820,
      "end_ms": 249775,
      "text": "张志忠先生主阵湖南省，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00129",
      "start_ms": 250090,
      "end_ms": 251910,
      "text": "他为了保护西南联大的学生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00130",
      "start_ms": 252070,
      "end_ms": 253150,
      "text": "亲笔给湘西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00131",
      "start_ms": 253170,
      "end_ms": 254295,
      "text": "各路土匪写信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00132",
      "start_ms": 254780,
      "end_ms": 255600,
      "text": "各路陆林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00133",
      "start_ms": 255600,
      "end_ms": 257280,
      "text": "豪杰山寨首领为剑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00134",
      "start_ms": 257500,
      "end_ms": 258340,
      "text": "日寇压境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00135",
      "start_ms": 258380,
      "end_ms": 259235,
      "text": "国难当头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00136",
      "start_ms": 259530,
      "end_ms": 265365,
      "text": "今有北大清华、南开、三校学生、数百人皆国家读书种子、民族未来栋梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00137",
      "start_ms": 265720,
      "end_ms": 267675,
      "text": "为保存文脉求学救国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00138",
      "start_ms": 267950,
      "end_ms": 269935,
      "text": "自长沙徒步西去昆明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00139",
      "start_ms": 270380,
      "end_ms": 270800,
      "text": "此辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00140",
      "start_ms": 270800,
      "end_ms": 271680,
      "text": "身无长物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00141",
      "start_ms": 271780,
      "end_ms": 273525,
      "text": "仅携书本手无寸铁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00142",
      "start_ms": 273890,
      "end_ms": 274870,
      "text": "斯特恳切。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00143",
      "start_ms": 274950,
      "end_ms": 279130,
      "text": "拜托凡学生队伍经过勿忘高抬贵手放行保护，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00144",
      "start_ms": 279290,
      "end_ms": 280190,
      "text": "不加侵扰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00145",
      "start_ms": 280230,
      "end_ms": 281005,
      "text": "误伤一人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00146",
      "start_ms": 281440,
      "end_ms": 283795,
      "text": "而当时沿路的土匪是这样回信的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00147",
      "start_ms": 284400,
      "end_ms": 284860,
      "text": "我辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00148",
      "start_ms": 285080,
      "end_ms": 286445,
      "text": "虽落草为寇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00149",
      "start_ms": 286740,
      "end_ms": 288040,
      "text": "亦是炎黄子孙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00150",
      "start_ms": 288160,
      "end_ms": 290520,
      "text": "中华儿女当知民族大义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00151",
      "start_ms": 290520,
      "end_ms": 291720,
      "text": "为重定将，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00152",
      "start_ms": 291760,
      "end_ms": 295000,
      "text": "保护学生安全购进、保护此文脉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00153",
      "start_ms": 295060,
      "end_ms": 296580,
      "text": "及所以护我之中华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00154",
      "start_ms": 296860,
      "end_ms": 297995,
      "text": "留复兴之根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00155",
      "start_ms": 299020,
      "end_ms": 301335,
      "text": "朱军武艺再高高不过天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00156",
      "start_ms": 301660,
      "end_ms": 301900,
      "text": "资质，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00157",
      "start_ms": 301900,
      "end_ms": 304780,
      "text": "再厚厚不过地刀光剑影，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00158",
      "start_ms": 304860,
      "end_ms": 306775,
      "text": "儿女情长快意恩仇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00159",
      "start_ms": 307080,
      "end_ms": 308935,
      "text": "天下苍生出试入试。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00160",
      "start_ms": 309210,
      "end_ms": 310510,
      "text": "都在江湖之中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00161",
      "start_ms": 311110,
      "end_ms": 315010,
      "text": "渡尽劫波兄弟在相逢一笑泯恩仇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00162",
      "start_ms": 315430,
      "end_ms": 316990,
      "text": "江湖从来不止属于大侠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00163",
      "start_ms": 317129,
      "end_ms": 322610,
      "text": "还有走镖的、行医的、说书的、唱戏的、卖艺的、跑堂的三教九流五花八门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00164",
      "start_ms": 322830,
      "end_ms": 324150,
      "text": "武侠以没有绝世武功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00165",
      "start_ms": 324310,
      "end_ms": 325409,
      "text": "只要有一门本事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00166",
      "start_ms": 325490,
      "end_ms": 329010,
      "text": "你就能在江湖上讨口饭吃武侠片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00167",
      "start_ms": 329010,
      "end_ms": 337050,
      "text": "爱拍山顶决战可真实的江湖更可能出现在山下渡口码头、驿路客栈、茶馆、庙会和市场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00168",
      "start_ms": 337050,
      "end_ms": 339100,
      "text": "江湖里卧虎藏龙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00169",
      "start_ms": 339160,
      "end_ms": 339520,
      "text": "庞龙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00170",
      "start_ms": 339740,
      "end_ms": 342920,
      "text": "人心里何尝不是刀剑里藏胸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00171",
      "start_ms": 343280,
      "end_ms": 345800,
      "text": "人情里何尝不是诸君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00172",
      "start_ms": 346120,
      "end_ms": 347360,
      "text": "人生有三碗面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00173",
      "start_ms": 347480,
      "end_ms": 348060,
      "text": "最难吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00174",
      "start_ms": 348620,
      "end_ms": 350760,
      "text": "场面铁面情面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00175",
      "start_ms": 351260,
      "end_ms": 354180,
      "text": "江湖可不是你想来就来想走就走的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00176",
      "start_ms": 354420,
      "end_ms": 355060,
      "text": "庄子说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00177",
      "start_ms": 355320,
      "end_ms": 357760,
      "text": "相濡以沫不如相忘于江湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00178",
      "start_ms": 358360,
      "end_ms": 359260,
      "text": "所谓江湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00179",
      "start_ms": 359420,
      "end_ms": 363260,
      "text": "就是五千年来中国人从未断绝的情谊与担当。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00180",
      "start_ms": 364000,
      "end_ms": 368955,
      "text": "桃李春风一杯酒江湖夜雨十年灯一人有意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00181",
      "start_ms": 369170,
      "end_ms": 373035,
      "text": "便能守住侠气万千人有意便能守住山河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00182",
      "start_ms": 373660,
      "end_ms": 378870,
      "text": "天下风云出我辈一入江湖岁月摧皇图霸业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f56f8c0f869bdde2_s00183",
      "start_ms": 378970,
      "end_ms": 382035,
      "text": "谈笑中不胜人生一场醉。"
    }
  ],
